{"type":"message","id":"afa49ad7","parentId":"6c4b6383","timestamp":"2026-06-25T05:37:18.060Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to craft a prompt based on the HEADLINE and SCENE_HINT, then run generate.sh.\n\nHEADLINE: Trump cancels signing of housing bill with CBDC ban\nSCENE_HINT: Price movement — gold Bitcoin 3D coin\n\nThe prompt should combine the SCENE_HINT with the HEADLINE context. Since it's about Bitcoin and price movement, with a political angle (Trump, housing bill, CBDC ban), I should craft something visual that represents this.\n\nLet me build the prompt under 300 characters:\n- Gold Bitcoin 3D coin (from SCENE_HINT)\n- Combined with the political/regulatory context\n\nPrompt idea: \"Gold Bitcoin 3D coin with US flag colors, dramatic price surge, cinematic crypto editorial, photorealistic, studio lighting, dark background, sharp focus\"\n\nLet me check character count and make it more specific to the news: Trump canceling a housing bill with CBDC ban - this suggests a negative/progressive move for crypto or a positive one for Bitcoin (because CBDC is often opposed by Bitcoin advocates).\n\nActually, I should make it about the Bitcoin price movement in a dramatic way, with some political undertone without showing readable text.\n\nLet me craft: \"3D gold Bitcoin coin rising dramatically, US Capitol dome silhouette in background, red and blue accents, cinematic crypto editorial, photorealistic, studio lighting, dark background, sharp focus\"\n\nThat should work. Let me run the generate.sh script.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_1KOZSYQtyta1l205Hm44Eg","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"OUTPUT_PATH=/tmp/coinography-run-20260625-053013-11872-6040/media/feature.jpg PROJECT_CONFIG=/home/bhard/.openclaw/projects/coinography.json PROJECT_SLUG=coinography bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"3D gold Bitcoin coin